 .../bindings/clock/st,stm32mp21-rcc.yaml      | 140 +++++++--------
 .../bindings/clock/st,stm32mp25-rcc.yaml      | 160 +++++++++---------
 .../bindings/clock/xlnx,clocking-wizard.yaml  |   2 +-
 4 files changed, 152 insertions(+), 152 deletions(-)

